WEBVTT

00:07.465 --> 00:09.467
[opening theme music playing]

00:12.303 --> 00:13.805
[wind gusting]

00:37.787 --> 00:42.000
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE 2

00:44.085 --> 00:46.087
[melodic pop music playing]

01:16.659 --> 01:17.660
[music stops]

01:17.744 --> 01:19.079
[gasps]

01:24.918 --> 01:26.002
[grunts]

01:26.961 --> 01:28.379
[groans]

01:29.089 --> 01:31.549
[panting]

01:35.261 --> 01:36.346
[coughs]

01:36.429 --> 01:39.099
[breathing heavily]

01:46.314 --> 01:48.316
[unsettling music playing]

01:55.573 --> 01:58.159
[breathing heavily]

02:11.131 --> 02:13.133
[breathing shakily]

02:15.385 --> 02:16.928
[moaning in distance]

02:21.099 --> 02:22.475
[boy] Please don't kill us.

02:24.519 --> 02:25.854
[girl's muffled crying]

02:25.937 --> 02:27.063
[boy] Don't kill us.

02:30.275 --> 02:31.734
[Chae-ok breathing nervously]

02:34.863 --> 02:36.865
[girl's crying continues]

02:43.413 --> 02:46.249
Don't kill us. Don't kill us.

02:48.793 --> 02:50.170
What happened in here?

02:52.005 --> 02:53.006
Don't kill us.

02:58.970 --> 03:00.805
Did I kill everyone?

03:01.598 --> 03:03.892
[girl whimpers, sobs]

03:06.352 --> 03:07.270
[Chae-ok gasps]

03:27.665 --> 03:29.667
[unsettling music continues]

03:35.798 --> 03:41.638
[chanting] Hurray for Independence!
Hurray for Independence!

03:41.721 --> 03:43.723
- [cheering]
- [pensive music playing]

03:56.361 --> 03:58.029
[Chae-ok] Gyeongseong will now…

04:01.199 --> 04:03.076
welcome in a new spring.

04:04.410 --> 04:06.412
[emotional music playing]

04:17.840 --> 04:19.092
But my winter

04:20.718 --> 04:22.095
has not yet ended.

04:36.859 --> 04:39.279
I will be left behind alone in this hell.

04:44.659 --> 04:46.244
Forgotten by everyone.

04:48.246 --> 04:49.372
[music fades]

04:51.332 --> 04:52.292
So why…

04:57.505 --> 04:58.673
after all this time,

04:59.674 --> 05:01.801
are these things happening all over again?

05:06.806 --> 05:07.890
Master Jang.

05:09.475 --> 05:12.437
[Chae-ok] How is it possible
that you are still here?

05:26.826 --> 05:27.744
[sighs]

05:32.999 --> 05:33.875
You, um,

05:35.001 --> 05:36.836
must have me confused with someone else.

05:40.673 --> 05:41.841
Who's Master Jang?

05:44.385 --> 05:46.095
I have no idea who that person is.

05:55.688 --> 05:57.440
Your name is not Jang Tae-sang?

05:57.523 --> 05:58.566
No, sorry.

06:00.109 --> 06:01.361
My name is Jang Ho-jae.

06:11.204 --> 06:12.288
Are you all right?

06:14.082 --> 06:15.583
[Chae-ok] What was I thinking?

06:16.709 --> 06:18.294
There's no way it could be him.

06:18.795 --> 06:19.754
[Ho-jae] Excuse me.

06:21.839 --> 06:23.257
[Chae-ok] It's just not possible.

06:24.801 --> 06:25.885
Answer me.

06:30.181 --> 06:31.140
Wait a minute.

06:31.224 --> 06:33.559
[wistful music playing]

06:33.643 --> 06:35.061
You haven't answered me yet.

06:39.732 --> 06:40.566
Answer what?

06:40.650 --> 06:42.568
Well, for one, tell me your name.

06:43.069 --> 06:46.322
What were you doing there that night,
and how are you connected to Oh Ki-hoon?

06:46.406 --> 06:49.367
And why do I have to tell you any of that?
I don't know you.

06:49.450 --> 06:51.702
Because I don't want to
take the fall for this.

06:52.537 --> 06:53.913
The police believe I'm the murderer

06:53.996 --> 06:56.124
all because I was at the wrong place
at the wrong time.

06:57.875 --> 07:00.753
So tell me, what were you doing there?

07:04.090 --> 07:05.341
I received a request

07:06.217 --> 07:07.677
to find a missing person.

07:08.428 --> 07:11.264
I was at the hotel
because I was looking for Oh Ki-hoon.

07:11.806 --> 07:13.474
He was already murdered when I got there.

07:15.059 --> 07:16.769
Looks like we're both
in the same boat, then.

07:16.853 --> 07:18.438
No, we're not in the same boat.

07:19.147 --> 07:20.648
You're the only one they've accused.

07:23.025 --> 07:24.944
You know the police have footage of you.

07:27.613 --> 07:29.782
So I think you'll be a suspect as well.

07:29.866 --> 07:30.992
So what?

07:32.994 --> 07:34.328
Wanna work together?

07:35.830 --> 07:38.374
I mean, neither of us are guilty here,

07:38.458 --> 07:40.251
and yet we're both considered
prime suspects,

07:40.334 --> 07:42.670
so how about we just help one another out?

07:43.296 --> 07:45.465
You ask as if
I'm going to say yes already.

07:47.008 --> 07:48.968
There's no downside to working with me.

07:49.844 --> 07:52.054
I'm not trying to sound
too full of myself saying this,

07:52.138 --> 07:56.601
but I am actually quite well-known
for this type of work.

07:57.602 --> 07:59.103
Well, I work on my own.

08:00.897 --> 08:03.024
I don't like to carry deadweight.

08:05.318 --> 08:08.237
You're not the only one
who likes working alone here.

08:09.989 --> 08:11.991
But a guy was murdered, huh?

08:15.620 --> 08:17.121
I won't let you punch me again.

08:21.959 --> 08:22.877
Word of advice?

08:24.253 --> 08:27.215
You won't be able to handle it
even if you do find the murderer.

08:27.298 --> 08:29.967
Thanks for your concern,
but I'll be the judge of that.

08:30.051 --> 08:31.177
Go for it, then.

08:32.303 --> 08:34.263
Just stay away,
and don't ride on my coattails.

08:34.347 --> 08:35.515
Ride on your coattails?

08:35.598 --> 08:37.558
You really… think that?

08:37.642 --> 08:38.559
Yes, I do.

08:40.478 --> 08:43.481
Now leave me alone and solve your problems
on your own, all right?

09:00.498 --> 09:01.332
[sighs]

09:04.502 --> 09:08.005
♪ Candles lit ♪

09:08.089 --> 09:13.261
♪ In the room ♪

09:14.637 --> 09:17.223
♪ Staring for ♪

09:17.306 --> 09:22.812
♪ Long time ♪

09:24.564 --> 09:28.025
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN FACT AND DISTORTION

09:28.109 --> 09:31.487
EPISODE 2
SIGN

09:34.115 --> 09:36.492
Oh, you're back.
So what happened out there?

09:36.993 --> 09:38.494
Were you able to find the woman at all?

09:38.578 --> 09:41.205
[Ho-jae] Not now.
I'm not really in the mood to talk.

09:46.168 --> 09:48.254
Hey, do you know a guy named Master Jang?

09:50.006 --> 09:50.840
Master who?

09:50.923 --> 09:52.216
Master Jang.

09:52.800 --> 09:54.635
Not at all. Never heard of him.

09:55.553 --> 09:56.387
Why?

09:56.470 --> 09:58.681
I found the woman,
and she called me that name.

09:59.557 --> 10:00.391
What'd you say?

10:00.975 --> 10:02.560
Well, I told her that I wasn't.

10:03.519 --> 10:05.479
However, that name
sounded really familiar,

10:05.563 --> 10:07.648
as if I've heard you use it before
or something.

10:08.524 --> 10:09.483
Me? No way.

10:10.651 --> 10:12.778
I've never heard the name until just now.

10:13.446 --> 10:14.322
[Ho-jae chuckles]

10:14.405 --> 10:17.158
[Yong-gil] I'm about to make some ramen.
Want some? It'll be quick.

10:17.241 --> 10:18.159
Uh, no, I'm good.

10:23.164 --> 10:25.166
[intriguing music playing]

10:32.506 --> 10:33.466
[sighs]

10:41.474 --> 10:42.683
[phone buzzing]

10:45.478 --> 10:47.313
Hi, Bugang Company, Ho-jae speaking.

10:50.608 --> 10:51.776
Who am I speaking with?

10:53.903 --> 10:54.862
[music fades]

10:56.947 --> 10:59.158
[unsettling music playing]

11:02.995 --> 11:04.580
[music fades]

11:10.836 --> 11:12.838
[mysterious music playing]

11:50.167 --> 11:51.210
[phone buzzes]

11:56.757 --> 11:57.842
[Madam Na] Job request.

11:57.925 --> 12:01.929
Missing person's name, Jang Ho-jae.
In his early thirties.

12:02.012 --> 12:04.265
He's been missing for about a year.

12:05.224 --> 12:07.727
They don't have a photo.
Sending a drawing for now.

12:07.810 --> 12:08.728
Are you available?

12:11.355 --> 12:12.356
Hmm.

12:16.235 --> 12:18.237
[unsettling music playing]

12:26.662 --> 12:27.580
[siren wailing]

12:27.663 --> 12:29.623
[tires squealing]

12:41.510 --> 12:42.595
[Ho-jae] Here you go.

12:43.179 --> 12:44.513
[woman] Thank you so much.

12:44.597 --> 12:45.931
[music fades]

12:47.558 --> 12:48.642
[slurps]

12:49.602 --> 12:51.604
Oh. Ethiopian.

12:52.188 --> 12:53.189
[Ho-jae] Paraguayan.

12:54.982 --> 12:56.275
[chuckles]

12:56.358 --> 12:59.153
I don't know coffee that well.
I took a wild guess.

12:59.236 --> 13:02.198
I don't know it that well either.
I read the label just now.

13:02.698 --> 13:03.657
Ah! [laughs]

13:05.034 --> 13:08.370
So I'm gonna bet you're not here
to discuss my coffee collection.

13:08.454 --> 13:10.331
So why don't we get to it?
Why did you come here?

13:10.998 --> 13:12.041
In that case…

13:16.921 --> 13:18.464
I'm here to show you this.

13:19.840 --> 13:20.883
JONGNO-GU SERIAL MURDER

13:20.966 --> 13:23.677
CASE REPORT

13:24.220 --> 13:25.387
[pensive music playing]

13:25.471 --> 13:27.807
A series of murders
have been occurring in our jurisdiction

13:27.890 --> 13:29.725
for at least the past two months.

13:29.809 --> 13:32.478
Mr. Oh Ki-hoon is the fifth victim.

13:32.561 --> 13:35.981
The five cases appear to be
identical in every way.

13:36.065 --> 13:39.944
Each of the bodies we've found so far
is missing an eye, as well as the brain.

13:40.027 --> 13:40.903
The brain?

13:42.905 --> 13:44.156
Like the one inside of here?

13:44.240 --> 13:48.202
To be honest, none of our investigators
know what's going on here.

13:48.285 --> 13:51.205
Nobody at the station has ever
seen this kind of murder before.

13:51.288 --> 13:53.332
And we still haven't figured out

13:53.415 --> 13:55.918
the murder weapon they used
to suck out the brain.

13:57.127 --> 13:59.922
But wait, um,
so this was all done by one person?

14:00.714 --> 14:03.300
Yes. It's the work of one killer.

14:03.384 --> 14:05.386
[light jazz music playing]

14:08.055 --> 14:09.223
Still no answer?

14:11.058 --> 14:14.228
You're more than welcome to leave
your phone number with me instead.

14:14.311 --> 14:16.355
If Silverbill accepts the job,
I'll text you.

14:17.439 --> 14:19.608
Have you been working long
with this Silverbill?

14:23.028 --> 14:25.281
I don't take questions
regarding Silverbill.

14:26.323 --> 14:28.284
Only regarding missing persons.

14:29.118 --> 14:30.286
[man] The job on Oh Ki-hoon…

14:32.454 --> 14:33.956
are you the one who took it?

14:38.419 --> 14:40.296
Ah!

14:42.673 --> 14:44.133
So you're essentially

14:45.551 --> 14:47.136
no more than a receptionist…

14:49.722 --> 14:50.556
aren't you?

14:55.811 --> 14:56.937
[door closes]

15:04.737 --> 15:06.697
I'M HEADING OVER NOW
DON'T COME

15:09.575 --> 15:11.577
[unsettling music playing]

15:14.455 --> 15:17.583
[squelching]

15:18.542 --> 15:21.545
I'm curious though. Why show this to me?

15:21.629 --> 15:24.757
Why go out of your way to share
private records of your investigation?

15:24.840 --> 15:26.133
I think it's only fair to you.

15:26.216 --> 15:29.428
You should at least know what kind of case
you're getting involved in

15:29.511 --> 15:33.015
and just how absolutely horrible
and gruesome the killer really is.

15:33.098 --> 15:34.767
It was the very least I could do for you.

15:35.392 --> 15:36.894
You're new to the Violent Crimes Unit.

15:36.977 --> 15:38.395
I transferred two months ago.

15:38.479 --> 15:39.939
How many cases have you solved?

15:40.022 --> 15:41.941
Just a couple so far. That's it.

15:42.024 --> 15:43.901
Yet you're in charge of
a serial murder case?

15:43.984 --> 15:46.070
It's not like I get to pick
whatever case I want.

15:46.153 --> 15:47.613
They tell me what to do, and I do it.

15:47.696 --> 15:50.199
Is that why you're hiding
a recording device there?

15:52.117 --> 15:53.202
[Ho-jae chuckles]

15:54.119 --> 15:57.164
It's pretty obvious in that spot,
don't you think?

16:01.043 --> 16:02.670
[sighs] Sorry about that.

16:02.753 --> 16:05.172
It's quite all right.
Caught you off guard?

16:05.255 --> 16:06.256
Yes. [chuckles]

16:06.340 --> 16:07.675
[phones buzzing]

16:09.259 --> 16:11.387
ANOTHER VICTIM FOUND
ALL DETECTIVES TO THE CRIME SCENE

16:11.470 --> 16:14.181
There's been another murder.
That makes six dead.

16:15.224 --> 16:17.226
- I'll go with you.
- What?

16:17.851 --> 16:19.436
- [door opens]
- Hey!

16:23.983 --> 16:25.985
[unsettling music playing]

16:26.485 --> 16:28.112
[tires squealing]

16:33.409 --> 16:35.869
[sirens wailing]

16:49.550 --> 16:52.344
[officer 1] We ask for your cooperation.
Please back up.

16:52.428 --> 16:54.430
Do not take pictures. Back up!

16:56.348 --> 16:57.558
Back up, please.

16:59.059 --> 17:01.228
- Watch out.
- This is a crime scene. Please back up.

17:01.311 --> 17:03.647
- Do you know who was hurt?
- This is a crime scene.

17:03.731 --> 17:06.066
- [man] Huh?
- Please move. Steer clear and away.

17:07.818 --> 17:09.820
[unsettling music continues]

17:11.947 --> 17:16.660
[camera shutter clicking]

17:18.037 --> 17:19.413
[sighs]

17:19.496 --> 17:20.998
[tuts] What a night.

17:21.081 --> 17:22.249
[sighs]

17:23.459 --> 17:25.419
[woman 1] I can't believe
this happened to her.

17:25.502 --> 17:27.588
[woman 2] I know. My goodness.
What do we do?

17:27.671 --> 17:29.006
[woman 1] How could this happen?

17:31.467 --> 17:32.926
She was such a kind woman.

17:42.061 --> 17:43.270
[phone buzzing]

17:50.069 --> 17:51.111
MADAM NA

18:01.205 --> 18:02.748
[music fades]

18:10.339 --> 18:11.340
Who are you?

18:13.759 --> 18:15.469
[man] How do you know Jang Ho-jae?

18:17.930 --> 18:19.348
Did you kill Madam Na?

18:19.431 --> 18:21.767
[mysterious music playing]

18:21.850 --> 18:24.895
She wouldn't answer my questions
and kept beating around the bush.

18:24.978 --> 18:25.854
And so…

18:28.357 --> 18:29.316
[Chae-ok chuckles]

18:31.026 --> 18:32.653
You bastard. I'll kill you.

18:34.363 --> 18:35.489
Tell me where you are.

18:38.575 --> 18:40.494
Tell me where you are right now.

18:40.577 --> 18:44.540
You didn't answer my question.
How about you answer it first?

18:44.623 --> 18:47.000
[officer 2] Please move out of the way.
Please move.

18:47.084 --> 18:49.670
Everyone, please step back.
This is a crime scene.

18:58.262 --> 18:59.388
Step back.

19:00.514 --> 19:01.723
[officer 1] Step back, please.

19:07.771 --> 19:10.023
Thanks for the ride.
We got here pretty quick.

19:13.735 --> 19:15.487
[indistinct chattering]

19:23.787 --> 19:25.664
[mysterious music playing]

19:39.136 --> 19:40.262
[disconnect tone]

19:43.307 --> 19:45.017
[unsettling music playing]

20:12.044 --> 20:13.879
- [tires squeal]
- [car horn honks]

20:30.896 --> 20:32.898
[breathing heavily]

20:40.280 --> 20:41.698
[music fades]

20:41.782 --> 20:43.283
[water burbling]

20:43.367 --> 20:45.869
[breathing heavily]

21:25.492 --> 21:27.828
[fluttering]

21:28.662 --> 21:30.372
[unsettling music playing]

21:33.000 --> 21:34.209
[thud echoing]

21:35.544 --> 21:38.463
[dramatic music playing]

21:51.393 --> 21:52.394
[Chae-ok gasps]

22:01.028 --> 22:02.112
That's strange.

22:02.195 --> 22:04.281
[music subsides]

22:04.364 --> 22:05.407
Why aren't you dead yet?

22:06.074 --> 22:07.409
From that impact,

22:07.993 --> 22:10.579
your neck should be broken
and your intestines ruptured.

22:13.206 --> 22:14.458
If you were human.

22:18.462 --> 22:19.755
[loud thud]

22:19.838 --> 22:20.797
[groans]

22:20.881 --> 22:22.215
Tell me who you are.

22:23.342 --> 22:24.801
Why'd you kill Madam Na?

22:25.594 --> 22:28.930
Did you kill Oh Ki-hoon too?
Are you the one behind all of this?

22:29.556 --> 22:30.599
[scoffs]

22:32.684 --> 22:33.602
You're…

22:35.979 --> 22:36.897
one of us, huh?

22:36.980 --> 22:39.232
[suspenseful music playing]

22:40.233 --> 22:41.693
[skin tearing]

22:42.486 --> 22:43.570
[grunts]

22:43.653 --> 22:45.781
[blood squelching]

22:50.369 --> 22:52.913
[reverential music playing]

23:03.215 --> 23:05.175
[grunts, groans]

23:10.806 --> 23:11.723
You are.

23:12.724 --> 23:13.934
[grunts]

23:16.520 --> 23:18.188
What the fuck are you doing?

23:20.065 --> 23:22.401
Hey, are you all right? Are you hurt?

23:29.366 --> 23:31.785
Hello? Someone's been stabbed.

23:31.868 --> 23:33.453
Please come quick. Hurry!

23:41.795 --> 23:44.464
Are you okay? Hold on a little longer.

23:44.548 --> 23:46.716
Help's on the way.
Stay with me, all right?

23:47.551 --> 23:51.012
Hey. Hey! Hey, you have to stay awake.

23:52.013 --> 23:53.014
Come on!

23:54.933 --> 23:57.477
[muffled] You have to stay awake!
Please wake up!

23:57.561 --> 23:59.563
- [echoing]
- [gasps]

24:14.119 --> 24:15.370
[Tae-sang] Did you sleep okay?

24:17.289 --> 24:19.082
[tender piano music playing]

24:22.502 --> 24:23.420
Hmm.

24:23.503 --> 24:27.132
You were sleeping so peacefully,
I didn't wanna wake you.

24:29.217 --> 24:34.431
♪ Candles lit in the room… ♪

24:35.807 --> 24:36.975
Oh, Master Jang.

24:39.186 --> 24:41.313
[breathing shakily]

24:41.980 --> 24:42.981
What's wrong?

24:43.648 --> 24:46.651
Did you… have a bad dream or something?

24:47.235 --> 24:52.949
♪ Staring for long time… ♪

24:53.033 --> 24:54.910
Actually, it was worse than a bad dream.

24:54.993 --> 24:57.829
♪ Where the wind came from… ♪

24:59.789 --> 25:01.249
It was terrifying…

25:02.709 --> 25:04.628
[sobs]

25:05.420 --> 25:06.421
…and lonely.

25:10.717 --> 25:11.718
Don't worry.

25:12.636 --> 25:13.762
It was only a dream.

25:15.472 --> 25:17.140
What matters is you're awake now.

25:17.224 --> 25:19.226
[music continues]

25:27.108 --> 25:29.402
Don't worry, okay?
I'm not gonna go anywhere.

25:31.029 --> 25:32.572
I will be right here with you.

25:33.448 --> 25:35.116
Right here by your side forever.

25:41.039 --> 25:46.336
♪ Candles lit in the room ♪

25:47.254 --> 25:52.592
♪ Wind from the chink, swayed by it ♪

25:53.134 --> 25:56.471
♪ It's like my mind ♪

25:56.555 --> 25:59.015
♪ It's just like me ♪

25:59.099 --> 26:04.020
♪ Staring for long time ♪

26:07.023 --> 26:08.066
[nurse 1] Please let go.

26:08.149 --> 26:10.360
She's lost a lot of blood
and needs treatment immediately.

26:10.443 --> 26:12.362
[music continues]

26:36.344 --> 26:37.804
[music fades]

26:55.071 --> 26:56.239
[phone buzzing]

26:59.117 --> 27:01.745
Mr. Chairman. I'm on level one. Why?

27:04.039 --> 27:04.873
What?

27:07.208 --> 27:08.335
What about last night?

27:08.418 --> 27:10.003
[footsteps approaching]

27:13.506 --> 27:17.218
JAZZ BAR OWNER IN HER 40S MURDERED
BODY FOUND WITH DAMAGED EYE

27:17.927 --> 27:19.929
I'll look into it and see what happened.

27:21.097 --> 27:23.975
Mr. Chairman, pay it no attention.
I'm on it. Don't worry.

27:24.059 --> 27:24.893
Okay?

27:25.477 --> 27:27.479
[mysterious music playing]

27:28.897 --> 27:30.899
[sighs] Call Seung-jo for me.

27:31.441 --> 27:32.942
[Kuroko04] Yes, sir. Right away.

27:34.277 --> 27:36.279
[unsettling music playing]

27:42.035 --> 27:42.994
[keypad beeps]

28:02.430 --> 28:04.724
Hey, where is the patient
that was in there?

28:04.808 --> 28:06.142
I don't know, Doctor.

28:06.226 --> 28:07.310
[sighs]

28:07.811 --> 28:10.855
Doctor, will she be okay?
Do you know if there are any updates?

28:10.939 --> 28:13.566
Uh, so actually, we're looking for her.

28:14.192 --> 28:16.611
They've been searching the entire building
to see where she is…

28:16.695 --> 28:18.071
[monitor beeping]

28:18.154 --> 28:20.824
…but it seems like she has disappeared.

28:21.783 --> 28:22.867
[Ho-jae] Disappeared?

28:24.244 --> 28:25.161
Where would--

28:37.257 --> 28:39.259
[unsettling music playing]

28:40.051 --> 28:40.969
[sighs]

28:42.721 --> 28:44.597
You didn't need to summon everyone
just for this.

28:47.726 --> 28:49.728
Don't you think
you're overreacting a little--

28:52.355 --> 28:53.940
[loud bang]

29:03.199 --> 29:05.201
[breathing heavily]

29:11.958 --> 29:15.086
You are not to cause any more trouble.
And stop going rogue.

29:15.170 --> 29:19.007
It's because I went rogue
that Oh Ki-hoon was taken care of.

29:19.883 --> 29:21.009
He figured us out.

29:21.092 --> 29:23.887
Listen and keep your mouth shut
when I am talking.

29:23.970 --> 29:26.306
[Seung-jo] How long
are we going to live like this?

29:26.389 --> 29:28.600
Are you gonna have us
live in hiding forever?

29:29.309 --> 29:32.103
With the powers we've got,
we should be living however we want to!

29:32.187 --> 29:33.480
[shoe crunching]

29:34.272 --> 29:35.648
[Seung-jo grunts]

29:35.732 --> 29:38.318
If you can't control
your impulsive behavior,

29:38.401 --> 29:40.111
then you have no real power.

29:41.070 --> 29:44.449
You only bring chaos and violence
wherever you go, Seung-jo.

29:46.409 --> 29:48.912
So from now on,
this is what's going to happen.

29:50.079 --> 29:52.707
Stay hidden
until all the commotion dies down.

29:52.791 --> 29:55.835
Keep quiet and behave.
I don't wanna hear a peep from you.

29:55.919 --> 29:57.921
[unsettling music continues]

29:58.922 --> 30:01.466
Mess up again, and you will be going
directly to the chairman

30:01.549 --> 30:03.968
to explain why
you've disappointed him yet again.

30:04.719 --> 30:06.137
I would be careful if I were you.

30:06.221 --> 30:08.223
[breathing heavily]

30:13.102 --> 30:14.813
[Seung-jo] Are you sure he's dead?

30:16.981 --> 30:18.024
Ho-jae.

30:20.193 --> 30:22.070
You were in charge of his execution.

30:33.665 --> 30:37.252
Seung-jo, don't ever
bring that person's name up again,

30:38.336 --> 30:39.420
or you're dead.

30:44.300 --> 30:45.760
[loud bang]

30:45.844 --> 30:48.137
JONGNO POLICE STATION

30:48.221 --> 30:49.430
[groans]

30:51.015 --> 30:52.767
Six victims and no suspects.

30:53.768 --> 30:55.562
No fingerprints. No evidence.

30:56.437 --> 30:57.689
And no patterns either.

30:57.772 --> 31:01.359
None of the victims have any relation
except the way they were murdered.

31:01.442 --> 31:02.569
[man 1 sighs]

31:04.279 --> 31:05.238
[groans]

31:08.992 --> 31:10.952
Were you able to get any leads, Detective?

31:12.745 --> 31:13.913
Detective Noh.

31:14.664 --> 31:15.748
Noh Ji-su!

31:18.459 --> 31:19.627
You have any updates?

31:20.211 --> 31:22.130
Oh, um… Well, nothing to report so far.

31:22.213 --> 31:24.591
- That's all?
- Sorry?

31:24.674 --> 31:26.843
Why are you sitting at your desk
doing nothing?

31:26.926 --> 31:28.887
Shouldn't you be somewhere right now?

31:28.970 --> 31:32.265
Like, um, following around Jang Ho-jae.

31:33.099 --> 31:35.768
It's what I told you to do,
not listen to music at your desk.

31:39.522 --> 31:40.690
I'll be off, Captain.

31:43.776 --> 31:44.736
[sighs]

31:51.200 --> 31:53.411
Why hasn't he come back yet?

31:56.581 --> 31:58.583
[mysterious music playing]

32:16.726 --> 32:20.188
[woman] The person they call Silverbill?
I don't know where she lives.

32:21.022 --> 32:23.691
Madam Na probably didn't know much
about them either.

32:28.279 --> 32:30.865
They communicated
almost everything by text.

32:31.824 --> 32:34.786
It looked like they only called each other
if it was urgent.

32:35.912 --> 32:39.666
Besides Madam Na, no one else knows
what the Silverbill looks like.

32:39.749 --> 32:41.417
[music fades]

32:43.795 --> 32:45.254
Why is it so bleak in here?

32:48.549 --> 32:49.801
[woman] Goodness.

32:50.301 --> 32:53.262
They say we are only given today
and never promised tomorrow.

32:53.346 --> 32:55.682
I never thought she would go like that.

33:06.401 --> 33:07.527
[woman gasps]

33:07.610 --> 33:09.320
Uh… It's way too much. No.

33:09.404 --> 33:11.698
I remember you said
your grandson graduated.

33:11.781 --> 33:13.366
Go buy him some new clothes.

33:13.449 --> 33:14.826
[chuckles]

33:15.827 --> 33:16.869
He's just so smart.

33:16.953 --> 33:20.248
He took a job exam recently,
and he passed the whole thing.

33:20.331 --> 33:22.583
He passed the interview first time around.

33:22.667 --> 33:24.335
Wow, he's got a job already?

33:24.419 --> 33:26.879
He is going to work at Jeonseung Lab now!

33:26.963 --> 33:28.214
[laughs]

33:29.924 --> 33:32.552
I think I'll buy him a new suit.
That's what I'll do.

33:33.511 --> 33:34.971
Thank you, President Jang.

33:35.638 --> 33:37.265
I'm not the president. Yong-gil is.

33:37.348 --> 33:41.436
Aw. All of us on the outside know
you're the real president, Master Jang.

33:41.519 --> 33:42.353
It's your ideas.

33:48.526 --> 33:49.360
What'd you say?

33:50.903 --> 33:51.738
Huh?

33:51.821 --> 33:53.823
[wistful music playing]

33:54.824 --> 33:57.326
The name you just called me.
Who's Master Jang?

33:58.703 --> 33:59.704
Oh, well…

34:01.956 --> 34:03.291
where you work now,

34:03.374 --> 34:07.295
there was a pawnshop there that was called
the House of Golden Treasure.

34:07.378 --> 34:10.381
My mother said
he was a kind and good person.

34:10.465 --> 34:14.260
In fact, everyone from that period
had good things to say about Master Jang.

34:15.053 --> 34:16.012
Yes.

34:17.221 --> 34:18.139
Right. So,

34:19.807 --> 34:20.641
who was he?

34:22.185 --> 34:23.227
He owned

34:24.979 --> 34:26.022
the pawnshop.

34:29.400 --> 34:30.526
Master Jang.

34:36.866 --> 34:38.868
[wistful music continues]

34:45.666 --> 34:46.667
[grunts]

35:05.728 --> 35:08.856
[man 1] The results of Experiment A0-67,
Mr. Chairman.

35:09.607 --> 35:11.859
Tell me, how far did we get this time?

35:11.943 --> 35:14.362
We were not able to pass stage two again.

35:14.946 --> 35:17.365
[unsettling music playing]

35:18.574 --> 35:19.992
[loud thud echoing]

35:24.080 --> 35:25.915
[low groaning]

35:26.833 --> 35:28.876
[snarling]

35:32.588 --> 35:34.924
[creature snarls]

35:35.007 --> 35:37.301
It feeds off of your fear,
so don't be frightened.

35:37.385 --> 35:39.929
And do your best to remain calm,
or else it will attack you.

35:40.763 --> 35:43.141
[footsteps thudding]

35:43.724 --> 35:45.017
[metallic clattering]

35:47.311 --> 35:49.313
[snarls]

35:52.358 --> 35:54.152
[snarling]

35:55.069 --> 35:58.781
[growling ferociously]

36:00.491 --> 36:01.909
[footsteps thudding]

36:01.993 --> 36:03.995
[high-pitched snarling]

36:06.998 --> 36:08.416
[footsteps thudding]

36:11.169 --> 36:13.171
[growls]

36:21.304 --> 36:22.972
Don't move. Keep very still.

36:24.473 --> 36:27.268
[man whimpering]

36:27.351 --> 36:28.811
[growls ferociously]

36:28.895 --> 36:31.480
[screaming] What is that thing?

36:32.565 --> 36:34.233
Keep calm, and don't break eye contact.

36:34.317 --> 36:36.611
Get me outta here! Someone help!

36:36.694 --> 36:38.279
- [skin tearing]
- [man screams]

36:38.988 --> 36:41.616
- [bones crunching]
- [blood squelching]

36:42.617 --> 36:44.076
[body thuds]

36:44.160 --> 36:46.162
[snarling]

36:46.245 --> 36:48.247
[unsettling music playing]

37:07.266 --> 37:10.311
I really don't have
much more patience for your failures.

37:10.811 --> 37:13.606
If you can't find a way
to control the test subjects,

37:13.689 --> 37:15.733
then the experiment won't move forward.

37:16.234 --> 37:19.320
If these results
continue to be insufficient, then I have

37:19.904 --> 37:22.490
no other choice but to bring him back.

37:23.866 --> 37:25.368
This project will not fail.

37:25.451 --> 37:29.372
You received that Najin in your brain
as a gift from the last chairman

37:29.455 --> 37:31.415
to serve as Jeonseung's protector.

37:31.958 --> 37:34.877
He provided you
with an opportunity to do great things.

37:34.961 --> 37:36.128
[pensive music playing]

37:36.212 --> 37:39.382
Don't ever forget how easily
a replacement can be found for you.

37:40.424 --> 37:43.010
So I wouldn't make any more mistakes
from here on out.

37:44.262 --> 37:45.596
I have not forgotten.

37:46.639 --> 37:48.975
- I will succeed soon.
- [groans]

37:50.476 --> 37:51.560
[sighs]

37:58.109 --> 37:59.193
And Seung-jo?

38:00.027 --> 38:02.905
He won't cause any more trouble for us.
I made sure of it.

38:02.989 --> 38:06.659
Tell him that if he messes up again,
then I will lock him up forever.

38:08.244 --> 38:09.745
A string of murders?

38:10.621 --> 38:12.248
I mean, in this day and age?

38:13.457 --> 38:14.583
[sighs]

38:16.711 --> 38:18.713
[unsettling music playing]

38:38.983 --> 38:40.776
[music fades]

38:40.860 --> 38:42.320
[Yong-gil slurps]

38:48.868 --> 38:52.121
Why aren't you eating, hmm?
It's getting soggy. You're wasting it.

38:55.583 --> 38:57.626
I heard this was a pawnshop
back in the day.

38:57.710 --> 38:59.170
The House of Golden Treasure.

38:59.920 --> 39:00.755
Oh yeah?

39:00.838 --> 39:02.131
[Yong-gil slurps]

39:02.214 --> 39:03.966
And the owner was a Master Jang.

39:04.050 --> 39:07.053
[coughing]

39:09.513 --> 39:11.307
[coughing continues]

39:13.059 --> 39:15.478
Even one of our informants knew.
You really didn't know?

39:17.188 --> 39:20.608
Not sure. [coughs]
I might've heard about it and just forgot.

39:23.319 --> 39:24.320
So what?

39:26.489 --> 39:27.531
Let me ask.

39:28.282 --> 39:33.412
When I was in that accident last year,
well, is there anything else you left out?

39:35.164 --> 39:36.123
No, there isn't.

39:36.791 --> 39:39.502
I think I told you everything pretty much.
Why are you asking?

39:39.585 --> 39:41.295
What else are you curious about?

39:41.921 --> 39:44.757
It's just, what if there is
something important I forgot?

39:46.258 --> 39:47.802
I can't even remember

39:49.011 --> 39:50.388
who I was before.

39:51.222 --> 39:54.141
Everything that I know
is from what you've told me.

39:59.730 --> 40:01.148
Ho-jae, you trust me?

40:01.732 --> 40:02.566
Of course.

40:02.650 --> 40:05.903
And you know there's no one in the world
who cares about you more than I do, right?

40:05.986 --> 40:07.530
[chuckles] Yes, I know.

40:07.613 --> 40:09.240
So take my word for it.

40:09.907 --> 40:13.702
I think you're much better off now
than you were before the accident.

40:14.829 --> 40:18.916
And maybe not remembering everything
is really all for the best, you know?

40:19.417 --> 40:23.546
When I look at you, I finally understand
why they say that ignorance is bliss.

40:23.629 --> 40:24.588
Everything's been reset,

40:25.214 --> 40:28.050
so I think you should just
take advantage of the opportunity, okay?

40:31.595 --> 40:33.055
Was my life before that bad?

40:33.139 --> 40:35.766
Ah! You're reading way too much into it.

40:35.850 --> 40:37.518
That is not what I'm saying here.

40:37.601 --> 40:41.397
Well, didn't you just say
that ignorance is bliss, Yong-gil?

40:41.480 --> 40:46.360
So I can't help but wonder
if my life, well, wasn't, uh… very good.

40:46.444 --> 40:47.570
Like, was I lousy?

40:48.654 --> 40:51.365
You need to know there was an accident,
and you lost your memory.

40:51.449 --> 40:53.367
I only want to remember…

40:57.329 --> 40:58.330
who I was.

40:59.790 --> 41:00.624
Ho-jae.

41:03.627 --> 41:04.628
Please tell me.

41:06.714 --> 41:08.090
What kind of guy was I?

41:09.800 --> 41:11.969
Was I a screwup or what, huh?

41:12.052 --> 41:14.013
[wistful music playing]

41:14.096 --> 41:15.014
Huh?

41:18.642 --> 41:19.643
All right, then.

41:21.187 --> 41:24.982
Well, you were a total deadbeat,
and that's the truth.

41:26.150 --> 41:28.652
You were either depressed,
miserable, or unhappy.

41:29.528 --> 41:30.863
There was always something wrong.

41:30.946 --> 41:32.865
For example, at times, you were paranoid,

41:32.948 --> 41:35.034
and that would result in
you having tantrums.

41:35.117 --> 41:38.787
You would throw things, destroy furniture,
and had bad anger management issues.

41:38.871 --> 41:41.123
But now, you're doing much better,

41:41.207 --> 41:44.460
so I don't want you to keep dwelling
on your past life anymore.

41:44.543 --> 41:45.794
All you need to do

41:46.587 --> 41:50.257
is be in this moment, have some faith,
explore, and enjoy your life, okay?

41:50.341 --> 41:52.384
To begin, how about you eat
the bowl of jajangmyeon.

41:52.468 --> 41:54.678
I cooked it, so be grateful
for everything I do for you.

42:14.281 --> 42:17.201
I guess it… must have been hard for you.

42:19.203 --> 42:20.704
- [phone buzzing]
- Hey, Ho-jae.

42:20.788 --> 42:21.914
[music fades]

42:21.997 --> 42:23.374
UNKNOWN NUMBER

42:24.458 --> 42:25.292
Yep, hello?

42:29.088 --> 42:30.047
Um, hello?

42:31.090 --> 42:32.049
[Chae-ok] It's me.

42:33.259 --> 42:34.218
Where are you?

42:34.843 --> 42:37.137
How's your injury? Are you all right?

42:38.514 --> 42:39.890
Can I come in for a minute?

42:43.852 --> 42:44.687
What…

42:44.770 --> 42:46.772
[pensive music playing]

42:55.906 --> 42:57.116
What are you doing here?

42:59.660 --> 43:00.786
Does your offer…

43:03.330 --> 43:04.206
still stand?

43:06.667 --> 43:08.502
To partner with each other.

43:11.839 --> 43:13.340
I wanna work with you.

43:14.967 --> 43:16.969
[reverential music playing]

43:30.941 --> 43:32.943
[reverential music continues]

44:35.631 --> 44:36.965
[phone buzzes]

44:39.885 --> 44:41.220
- Yes, hello?
- [music fades]

44:41.303 --> 44:43.305
[chiming]

44:54.233 --> 44:56.235
["Dawn" by Kim A Reum playing]

45:18.465 --> 45:20.926
♪ Walking down the road ♪

45:21.468 --> 45:23.220
♪ Where the darkness falls ♪

45:23.303 --> 45:26.098
♪ I see the truth ♪

45:26.181 --> 45:30.144
♪ That lead us through the ebb and tide ♪

45:30.227 --> 45:33.021
♪ Our souls will blend ♪

45:33.105 --> 45:37.109
♪ Love that never fades
And never cease ♪

45:37.901 --> 45:40.738
♪ All right, all right, all right ♪

45:40.821 --> 45:42.614
♪ In your embrace ♪

45:42.698 --> 45:45.492
♪ I could never feel the pain ♪

45:45.576 --> 45:49.705
♪ I could even let go of all fears ♪

45:49.788 --> 45:52.458
♪ Your eyes shine like guiding lights ♪

45:52.541 --> 45:54.334
♪ In this tough world ♪

45:54.418 --> 45:57.212
♪ Our stories unfold ♪

45:57.296 --> 46:01.425
♪ All the traces will never disappear ♪

46:01.508 --> 46:04.636
♪ In your eyes I see the dawn ♪

46:05.888 --> 46:08.432
♪ When all the hope seems lost ♪

46:08.974 --> 46:11.435
♪ Your love gives me strength ♪

46:11.935 --> 46:14.229
♪ With you by my side ♪

46:14.855 --> 46:17.649
♪ All my fears just fade away ♪

46:17.733 --> 46:21.320
♪ Shadows loomed over, don't be afraid ♪

46:21.403 --> 46:27.534
♪ Our story lives on in the city's lore ♪

46:28.035 --> 46:30.537
♪ In the heart of Seoul ♪

46:30.621 --> 46:33.373
♪ Oh in this urban canvas ♪

46:33.457 --> 46:36.210
♪ Like stars we will shine bright ♪

46:36.794 --> 46:39.671
♪ Finding the place that we both belong ♪

46:39.755 --> 46:42.216
♪ Follow me through the dark ♪

46:42.299 --> 46:45.177
♪ Oh in this city's chaos ♪

46:45.260 --> 46:48.096
♪ We're lighting up the skies ♪

46:48.180 --> 46:51.350
♪ Keep searching for answers
To who we are ♪

46:51.433 --> 46:53.852
♪ Till the end of the time ♪

46:53.936 --> 46:57.981
♪ Go on ♪

46:58.065 --> 47:00.484
♪ On, on ♪

47:00.984 --> 47:03.070
♪ On, on ♪

47:03.153 --> 47:05.656
♪ Follow me through the dark ♪

47:05.739 --> 47:09.243
♪ Go on ♪

47:09.743 --> 47:12.204
♪ On, on ♪

47:12.704 --> 47:14.790
♪ On, on ♪

47:14.873 --> 47:18.585
♪ Love will grow in the symphony of life ♪

47:19.086 --> 47:21.129
♪ I'm in the deep end ♪

47:21.755 --> 47:23.507
♪ Veiled in the fog ♪

47:23.590 --> 47:25.133
[music fades]
